! Data file of the converged operating point
! corresponds to the load flow solution of 'case2746wp.m' 
! relies on the file poland2746wp.dat and adds larger Q limits to generators under voltage control
! slack generator maximum active power limit shlould be increased since it is at its maximum limit of 1100 MW 
! 7 generators with cost=0.01 have been declared under P control (G132, G133, G205, G206, G792, G1462, G2002) !
! Pmin should be around 3-4 times less than Pmax (as for RTE generators) !!!
! the phase shifter T87 has been considered as LTC trafo only and its angle reduced from -0.6 to 0.0
! the output of the slack generator G28 has been reduced from 1132.2 MW (which was larger than Pmax) 
! to 1032.2 MW to improve convergence of IPM; the load flow solution provided corresponds to the 1132.2 MW 
